==Nyanko Great War! Strap Set==
'''Nyanko Great War! Strap Set''' is the only box set campaign that exists. It features the mystery keychain strap from the second campaign, [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]], and [[Blue Shinobi (Special Cat)|Blue Shinobi]].
